WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:11.086
Open the Forecast tab to see the live weighted revenue forecast. For fiscal year twenty twenty-six, the current forecast is one hundred twenty-four point nine million dollars.

00:11.886 --> 00:22.936
The total combines won revenue at one hundred percent with open pipeline multiplied by each deal's Win Confidence. The cards separate won revenue, weighted open pipeline, and weighted margin.

00:23.736 --> 00:33.976
Confidence coverage shows how much of the book has a usable Win Confidence. The orange notice calls out deals that still need one, so missing values are visible instead of being guessed.

00:34.776 --> 00:47.132
The fiscal year twenty twenty-seven tab uses the same logic and currently reads one hundred forty-one point seven million dollars. Keep Win Confidence current as deals progress, and the forecast moves automatically.
